            "title": "<h4><strong>A MEETING OF MINDS</strong></h4>",
            "description": "<p>For Antonin, his design approach is all about the relationship between the garment and the body. When the two align, there’s a deeper connection within the wearer—a sense of sensuality, of confidence, of freedom. Having experienced this energy first-hand, Kylie stepped into an extraordinarily natural rhythm when designing alongside Antonin. Their limitless creativity and effortless synergy in working together can be felt by the sense of ease within the collection. The pieces are striking without being overly opulent. Every fragment of each design—the dimensional draping, the architectural lines, the fluidity of the fabric—work together harmoniously, just like Kylie and Antonin. </p>",
