            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>This limited-edition collection—designed to be versatile for either a mix-and-match look, or a monochromatic moment—is an exhibition of connection. It’s not about what it seems, it’s about how it feels. The designs flirt with asymmetry, finding balance in unconventional ways. The fabrication presents femininity in form—molding to the body, honoring its natural shape. The color palette honors the co-existence of playfulness and maturity, resisting expectation that only one can hold true. “It’s a message of freedom, an embrace of who you are, a discovery of connection within oneself,” as Antonin describes.</p>",
